                <pb facs="0829" n="709" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg709"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4387: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Harbin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hanson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-27T12:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">May 27,
                                1922—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 8:44 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Chinese soldiers revolt against Chang Tso-lin evidently spreading throughout
                    railway zone, Legation informed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
